    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 00 · Setup (run once)\nClick **Execute workflow**. It creates the 6 data tables every agent uses and adds a little fictional demo data so you can try each agent straight away.\n\n**Safe to run again:** existing tables are kept, and demo data is only added to tables that are still empty.\n\nCheck the result under **Overview → Data tables**: you should see 6 tables starting with pmd_.",
